# Day-to-day: serverless app: API gateway, functions, queue, object storage and a table.
title "Serverless"
dir RIGHT
user(User)
apigw[API Gateway] :purple
fn1[Function: upload]
fn2[Function: thumbnail]
fn3[Function: notify]
s3[(Object storage)] :teal
ddb[(Metadata table)] :teal
q{Queue} :yellow
user -> apigw : POST /upload
apigw -> fn1
fn1 -> s3 : put object
fn1 -> ddb : record
s3 -> q : created event
q -> fn2
fn2 -> s3 : write thumbnail
q -> fn3
fn3 -> user : email
